      "start_seconds": 239.32,
      "end_seconds": 253.07,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "Okay, finished. Let me tell you where I've got to. I don't have a clear answer today: a reactive lymph node after a throat infection is possible, and so is a persistent infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.89,
      "end_seconds": 258.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
