      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.68,
      "end_seconds": 295.08,
      "duration_seconds": 36.4,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a reactive lymph node after a throat infection do well once it's treated properly i think blood tests makes sense here, for neck lump i'm sending you for an ultrasound of the neck because of neck lump check the lump once a week and let me know if it grows or becomes hard don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day"
